# PUT API Requests

## Overview

This document provides examples of **PUT API requests** for manual API testing. PUT requests are commonly used to **update existing resources** such as users, products, and reviews.

Each example includes the HTTP method, endpoint, required headers, request body, expected response status, response body, and relevant validation scenarios.

